# nord — the Nord palette, mapped onto Ergon's 22 roles.
#
# Upstream: https://github.com/nordtheme/nord
# Licence:  MIT
#
# Nord publishes exactly sixteen colours, nord0-nord15, and no light/dark
# variants: four Polar Night darks, three Snow Storm lights, four Frost blues,
# five Aurora accents. Every value below is one of those sixteen.

# -- neutrals: Polar Night, then Snow Storm ---------------------------------
COOL_BG0=#2E3440          # nord0
COOL_BG1=#3B4252          # nord1
COOL_BG2=#434C5E          # nord2
COOL_FG0=#ECEFF4          # nord6
COOL_FG1=#E5E9F0          # nord5
COOL_DIM=#D8DEE9          # nord4
COOL_DIMMER=#4C566A       # nord3
# -- the ramp: Frost, then one Aurora purple --------------------------------
COOL_0=#8FBCBB
COOL_1=#88C0D0
COOL_2=#81A1C1
COOL_3=#5E81AC
COOL_4=#B48EAD
# -- alert pair -------------------------------------------------------------
COOL_HOT_0=#88C0D0
COOL_HOT_4=#B48EAD
# -- off-ramp tints ---------------------------------------------------------
COOL_MINT=#A3BE8C         # nord14
COOL_BLUSH=#B48EAD        # nord15
# -- semantic aliases -------------------------------------------------------
COOL_ACCENT=#81A1C1       # nord9
COOL_ACTIVE=#88C0D0       # nord8, the Frost blue Nord is known by
COOL_URGENT=#BF616A       # nord11
COOL_WARN=#EBCB8B         # nord13
COOL_GOOD=#A3BE8C         # nord14
COOL_INACTIVE=#434C5E     # nord2
